{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loop My Crank</strong> is an absurd clicker-type game where cranking a handle is not just a mechanic, it's a lifestyle\u2026 and maybe a cult. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with one rusty crank, and end up harnessing the power of Earth, nuclear reactors, and even the spinning force of the universe itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy increasingly ridiculous upgrades, recruit followers who spin out of pure belief, and watch your coin production spiral into madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker? Idle? Looper? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doesn\u2019t matter. Just spin. Always spin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never stop spinning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the free DEMO.</strong> It includes the core crank loop, early upgrades, and your first true believers.<br>Your feedback is gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/728ad9ede0107c2ae5885dd25b5c7bcf.poster.avif?t=1757185339\" width=400 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/728ad9ede0107c2ae5885dd25b5c7bcf.webm?t=1757185339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936880/extras/728ad9ede0107c2ae5885dd25b5c7bcf.mp4?t=1757185339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why wishlist?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re a tiny 2-dev team, wishlists and demo downloads help us a lot to get visibility and resources. If you like the demo, <strong>add it to your wishlist</strong>, it directly brings the full release <strong>much sooner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\